    "Pin the hours you want after a light, moderate, or hard session and Recharge uses them instead of its own figure for sessions that size. Leave a band on \"Recharge decides\" and nothing changes. Which band a session lands in is read from your own recent sessions, not from a fixed threshold.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pin the hours you want after a light, moderate, or hard session and Recharge uses them instead of its own figure for sessions that size. Leave a band on \"Recharge decides\" and nothing changes. Which band a session lands in is read from your own recent sessions, not from a fixed threshold."
          }
        }
      }
    },
