    "Recharge estimates a training-load recovery window from your recent workouts. It is not a measure of muscle repair, illness, injury risk, or whether you are fit to train, and it is not medical advice. Talk with a qualified health professional before making medical decisions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge estimates a training-load recovery window from your recent workouts. It is not a measure of muscle repair, illness, injury risk, or whether you are fit to train, and it is not medical advice. Talk with a qualified health professional before making medical decisions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge gives a cardiovascular training estimate from your Apple Health data. It is not medical advice and does not diagnose, treat, or prevent any condition. Talk with a qualified health professional before making medical decisions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
