          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge gives a cardiovascular training estimate from your Apple Health data. It is not medical advice and does not diagnose, treat, or prevent any condition. Talk with a qualified health professional before making medical decisions. Your Health data stays on your devices; only purchase information is handled by Apple and RevenueCat.": {
